m\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/12837","title":"Second Annual Backyard Ultra (Lite)","description":"<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">\n<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs\"><strong>DATE: SUNDAY SEPT 20th, 2026<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><strong>TIME: 9:00 AM start<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><strong>WHERE: Otway (8141 Otway Rd)<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><strong>WHY: Fundraiser for the CNSC Race Teams<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><strong>TWO CLASSES: Recreation (solo and relay) and Almost an Ultra (Last Runner Standing)<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><\/div>\n<h5 class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t9d\/1\/16\/1f45f.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udc5f\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> RECREATION CLASSES:<\/h5>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">\u2022 Solo (14+) or relay team (12+) of 2 (each runner does 4 loops in any order)<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 3.35 km loops<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 Loop \u201crequired finish time\u201d decreases by 1 minute every lap (starts at 30 minutes, ends at 23 minutes)<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 Capped number of loops at 8 = 26.8km<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 First rec male and female across the line win! Prizes to be announced.<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 Prize for first relay team across the line.<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 Other awesome category winner prizes &amp; draw prizes every 30 min<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 Finish lines snacks and drinks to keep you fueled.<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 Music, food, try biathlon ( eco aim)<\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><\/div>\n<h5 class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t3d\/1\/16\/1f3c5.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udfc5\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span>\u00a0ALMOST ULTRA CLASS:<\/h5>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">\u2022 Open to 16+<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 Continues after the Recreations classes are done.<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 The time available to do each lap continues to drop by 1 min each lap.<br class=\"html-br\" \/>\u2022 Almost an Ultra winners are the last male and female to complete a lap, or the first across the line on the final lap everyone is willing to run. Prizes to be announced.<\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Map is located in the discussion section here.<\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Ages as of Dec 31, 2026. Must be 14+ for Rec Solo, 12+ for a team, and 16+ for Almost an Ultra. Teams may be mixed ages and genders.<\/div>\n<h5 class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">\u00a0REGISTER EARLY AND SAVE! <a href=\"https:\/\/zone4.ca\/register.asp?id=41936&amp;fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExd1o5REZBR2FZcWxLdU5iVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4svlotM1O1vXldQtDQ6qljod04g2Xp1ceVBnGyPOy_5m1Hv3xphIMZQXw1KA_aem_pToG_lfwssfOI-H92Ldrhg\">CLICK HERE TO REGISTER NOW!\u00a0<\/a><\/h5>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tab\/1\/16\/1f3c3_200d_2642.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span>\u00a0Early birds register now on Zone4 until Sept 19 at 6:00 PM.<\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Price: $30 Rec solo, $50 Rec Team, $50 Almost an Ultra<\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">***2nd relay team member must register separately for $3 and pay the Tier 3 License Fee***<\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/ta9\/1\/16\/1f3c3_200d_2640.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span>\u00a0The \u201cI\u2019ll do it later\u201d crew can still register onsite on Sept 20\u2026 for a slightly more expensive life choice\u00a0<span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/td2\/1\/16\/1f604.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\ude04\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x